shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","review_id":"PEFYy-_hR2xJuF9vhbH8aA","date":"2011-05-28T00:52:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9515445232391357,"text_excerpt":"Ok, so the bar is tight, crowded, and hot. But when the music is good, who cares? I caught the Rebirth Brass Band here last Tuesday. The band (which has at least nine members) went all out and I had a great time. Started late and had an extended break, so made for a long night. Cover on the pricey side at fifteen dollars, but enjoyed the show. If you don't have a car, you can pretty readily find a taxi in the area. There are some interesting restaurants and bars near the Maple Leaf as well."},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","review_id":"nTXl2PJJeRsgDfv9fgch6A","date":"2014-02-21T00:14:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9440619945526123,"text_excerpt":"Had a hell of a time in this joint on Tuesday night! My friend who is a new resident of New Orleans told me an awesome band called Rebirth. Cover was $15 and there isn't an ATM inside so make sure you bring the dollars. Whoever does the lighting in the place is awesome as it give off a great vibe while listening to some awesome jazz. The band rocks on stage while the crowd rocks out below on the main floor. There is a bench on the wall for sitting drinks or standing to get a better view as it gets mad crowded here so get ready to sweat. Drink prices are standard as they of course have a full bar. This is definitely a place I will try every time I go to NOLA."},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","review_id":"7tbS3CwBv8MZKU2iTpJ1qw","date":"2007-11-02T15:51:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9416236281394958,"text_excerpt":"This place is a MUST. GO. Now. If you don't make it for Tuesday nights when Rebirth Brass band is playing, then you are not experiencing New Orleans. I guarantee you will have the time of your life. It gets insanely packed. People are dancing like crazy and drinking with gusto. If you need to chill out, head to the back patio. PS - There is a cover at this bar. But it's worth it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","photo_id":"tWsuwz1Pw_zr9d4xsO_PYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tWsuwz1Pw_zr9d4xsO_PYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8942294120788574},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","photo_id":"ePCbdL-XRWi1mxzxABBGZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ePCbdL-XRWi1mxzxABBGZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8929791450500488},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","photo_id":"SxFPNh3yLRgruMaUdKxI1g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/SxFPNh3yLRgruMaUdKxI1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8838809728622437},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","photo_id":"CSi9emNZtYSAxPitF8VIEQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/CSi9emNZtYSAxPitF8VIEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8344382643699646},{"business_id":"dSv7qHrkYF4nmQQA0QRP_g","photo_id":"WNe5Gda5SEPkHqr8hHSk8A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WNe5Gda5SEPkHqr8hHSk8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7738736867904663}]},"notebook_case":null}
